{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"利未记","commonName":"利未记","title":"利未记","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"99d9beb158820300746e3672c3d2089e04f5e3bf87009a6b1798d024d009597c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":858},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["燔祭的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华从会幕中呼叫摩西，对他说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你晓谕以色列人说：你们中间若有人献供物给耶和华，要从牛群羊群中献牲畜为供物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「他的供物若以牛为燔祭，就要在会幕门口献一只没有残疾的公牛，可以在耶和华面前蒙悦纳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他要按手在燔祭牲的头上，燔祭便蒙悦纳，为他赎罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他要在耶和华面前宰公牛；亚伦子孙作祭司的，要奉上血，把血洒在会幕门口、坛的周围。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那人要剥去燔祭牲的皮，把燔祭牲切成块子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司亚伦的子孙要把火放在坛上，把柴摆在火上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["亚伦子孙作祭司的，要把肉块和头并脂油摆在坛上火的柴上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但燔祭的脏腑与腿要用水洗。祭司就要把一切全烧在坛上，当作燔祭，献与耶和华为馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「人的供物若以绵羊或山羊为燔祭，就要献上没有残疾的公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["要把羊宰于坛的北边，在耶和华面前；亚伦子孙作祭司的，要把羊血洒在坛的周围。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["要把燔祭牲切成块子，连头和脂油，祭司就要摆在坛上火的柴上；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["但脏腑与腿要用水洗，祭司就要全然奉献，烧在坛上。这是燔祭，是献与耶和华为馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["「人奉给耶和华的供物，若以鸟为燔祭，就要献斑鸠或是雏鸽为供物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["祭司要把鸟拿到坛前，揪下头来，把鸟烧在坛上；鸟的血要流在坛的旁边；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["又要把鸟的嗉子和脏物",{"noteId":0},"除掉，丢在坛的东边倒灰的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["要拿着鸟的两个翅膀，把鸟撕开，只是不可撕断；祭司要在坛上、在火的柴上焚烧。这是燔祭，是献与耶和华为馨香的火祭。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"脏物：或译翎毛","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/40.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}